(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gates/src/docExtract.asl#" :text "Extracts module, fn and field :d docstrings, (:m :why ...) comment text and free ; comments from ASL source into doc ledger rows per decision D150 and its DOCSTORE scope add, using asl-parser/ast to locate every doc form (no regex on ASL) and a line scan for comments (comments are not AST nodes). Dry run by default: findCandidates! locates every doc string and the byte span that would be removed or rewritten; stripSource builds the edited source text; nothing is written to disk unless applyExtract! is called. Assert messages are left untouched: they are not comments.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gates/src/docExtract.asl#DocCandidate.symbol" :text "path#name, path# for a module doc, path#Type.field for a field doc, path#name or path#Lline for a comment")
